00:11:32,519 --> 00:11:35,669
T'OU JIU DY VE ANCHASLEY FASTYR JIU AS

210
00:11:35,669 --> 00:11:38,550
ESHYN CHOUDS VEH JEEAGHYN ORRYM MYR NAGH ROW

211
00:11:38,549 --> 00:11:40,049
EE RIEAU ER VAKIN MEE ROIE

212
00:11:41,519 --> 00:11:43,680
VA DRA GHLEN AYM ER MY EDDIN AS

213
00:11:44,009 --> 00:11:45,960
LURG DOU JUAN ER MY OOREYDER VA FYS

214
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:48,480
AYM DY BARE LHIAM GYN CUMRAIL ER NONNEY

215
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,980
VEAGH ESHYN GEEARREE FAAGAIL

216
00:11:51,629 --> 00:11:54,480
GHOW MEE EH BOLGUM JERRINAGH AS HIE MEE

217
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:57,210
SHEESE ER Y LAARE FAGGYS DA'N CHLOIEDER JUS

218
00:11:57,210 --> 00:11:57,780
CUMMEY AYM

219
00:11:59,429 --> 00:12:00,299
GEEARREE STIVELL

220
00:12:01,470 --> 00:12:03,870
Y DOALTATTYMAGH HONNICK MEE MEE HENE MYR VA

221
00:12:03,870 --> 00:12:08,429
MEE CEAU EADDAGH JESH AGH GYN BREAGYN FOLT

222
00:12:08,429 --> 00:12:11,940
OOILLEY CROGHEY SHEESE AS BLAA JOUGH-OOYL OO JEH

223
00:12:11,940 --> 00:12:16,199
MY CHLEAYSH BOGHTEY NEE SHENNAYR KEAYRTEE FAAGAIL SMOOINEE

224
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:19,980
MEE WELL SHIAULTEYR JUS CUMMEY AS MISH TA

225
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:21,840
MEE SHEILTYN DY VEL EH ORT SCOILL NISH

226
00:12:23,129 --> 00:12:26,759
AGH AYNS YNNYD JEH SHEN HAINK EH DOU

227
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:28,500
AS HIE EH SHEESE KIART LIORYMS

228
00:12:29,700 --> 00:12:31,799
CHA NEL TA PALCHEY TRAA AYM MY VEES

229
00:12:31,799 --> 00:12:33,539
SHEN KIART DY LIOOAR MERCHYS ESHYN

230
00:12:38,850 --> 00:12:41,970
JOUGH VRIE YN SKEEAL SHEN SCRUIT SY VAARLE

231
00:12:41,970 --> 00:12:45,330
EC MOGREY DAAGHYN AS BRISBANE THALLOO REN REAMYSSYN

232
00:12:45,330 --> 00:12:48,239
AUSTRALIA AS CHYNDAAIT SY GHAELG SON CLAARE NY

233
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:51,450
GAEL AS LESH MEERYN ASS YN DAA GHLARE

234
00:12:51,450 --> 00:12:53,639
SHEN GOLL AS GACCAN AS GRA MY GHAELG

235
00:12:54,090 --> 00:12:56,759
SHEN EH REESHT VOISH Y CHOCHARREY SHOH ABBYR

236
00:12:56,759 --> 00:12:58,199
SHEN REESHT TRA NEOO

237
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:32,759
O EANISHYN

